OL,3,GNEWSASacked police officer showed 'all 
OL,4,Athe hallmarks of predatory behaviour'  
OL,6,FA police officer has been sacked after 
OL,7,Fsending sexualised messages to a       
OL,8,Fvulnerable woman whose harassment      
OL,9,Fcomplaint he was investigating.        
OL,11,FHe also failed to properly investigate 
OL,12,Fcounter-allegations made by her        
OL,13,Fex-partner, a Police Ombudsman         
OL,14,Finvestigation has found.               
OL,16,FHugh Hume, chief executive of the      
OL,17,FPolice Ombudsman's Office, said the    
OL,18,Fofficer had shown "all the hallmarks of
OL,19,Fpredatory behaviour".                  
